          "title": "Automatic Accordion",
          "subtitle": "A real accordion. Playing automatically.",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A self-playing acoustic accordion with MIDI-controlled keys and precisely regulated airflow. Designed and built by Decap Herentals.",
